<title>USA: Racotek says to cut operating costs.</title>
<headline>Racotek says to cut operating costs.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Racotek Inc said it intends to focus  on fewer markets and cut operating expenses by up to 25 percent by  the fourth quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;The savings will be accomplished by reduced headcount, consolidating  facilities, and curbing discretionary spending,&quot; said the software  and mobile data systems business.</p>
<p>Racotek said it will close two of its four sales offices and reduce  headquarters office space. Sixteen jobs have been eliminated and a  few more will be by attrition, Racotek said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
